{"id": "315aec73-5dc4-40b7-a990-20a7693ecc0d", "timestamp": "2026-10-19T23:13:11.355363", "source": "agent", "parent_id": "db173ac8-a04d-462c-9267-28eec27f80a2", "thought": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "Inspection complete. Here are my findings and proposed approach.

## Inspection findings

